# Craft toolkit error sentences.
error-craft-arguments-invalid = A file location is missing or incomplete. Give the full location of the file.
error-craft-conversion-unavailable = The app that converts files isn't installed or hasn't been confirmed yet. Set it up and try again.
error-craft-datastore-unavailable = ordin can't reach its app records right now. Try again in a moment.
error-craft-download-failed = The download failed even after several tries. Check your connection and try again.
error-craft-duplicate = That app, or that file type, is already in the list.
error-craft-files-failed = ordin couldn't save the file. Check there is room and try again.
error-craft-hash-mismatch = The downloaded file isn't the one ordin expected, so it wasn't used. Try again later.
error-craft-install-failed = The app couldn't be unpacked. Try the download again.
error-craft-not-approved = Your company hasn't approved that app.
error-craft-not-installed = That app is approved but not installed yet. Install it first.
error-craft-no-mcp-mode = That app can't be used by ordin in this way.
error-craft-open-failed = The file couldn't be opened. Try again.
error-craft-open-refused = ordin won't open that file because it is a program that would run. Only open it yourself if you trust where it came from.
error-craft-output-missing = The app finished but produced no file. Try again.
error-craft-output-too-large = The result is larger than 256 MiB, which is too big to keep. Try a smaller file.
error-craft-path-not-allowed = That file is outside the places ordin may use. Choose a file from one of your places.
error-craft-platform-unsupported = That app isn't available for this computer.
error-craft-server-start-failed = The app didn't start within 15 seconds. Try again.
error-craft-start-blocked = Your computer wouldn't let the app start. Check your security settings, or tell IT.
error-craft-timeout = The app took longer than 2 minutes, so ordin stopped it. Try a smaller file.
error-craft-tool-failed = The app reported a problem and couldn't finish. Try again.
error-craft-tool-not-offered = That app feature isn't available in this conversation.
error-craft-unverified-install = The app was installed without being checked. Install it again from a trusted source.
error-ftm-extension-duplicate = That file type is already set up for an app.
error-ftm-extension-invalid = That file type isn't valid. Use 1 to 16 lower-case letters or digits after the dot, such as pdf.
error-ftm-immutable = File type settings can't be edited one by one. They change only when your organisation's settings are replaced.
error-ftm-media-type-invalid = The kind of file given for that file type isn't valid. Check it and try again.
